    "output": "still-mods options\n  planProgress       on            Plan progress bars  (on | off)\n  planEnforcement    soft          How hard Claude is held to its bars  (strict | soft | off)\n  sounds             soft          Sounds for decision, error, done  (soft | classic | off)\n  turnNotify         on            Sound and toast when a long turn ends  (on | off)\n  turnNotifySeconds  60            Seconds a turn must last to notify  (a number)\n  gitStatus          on            Git status line (branch, changes, ahead/behind)  (on | off)\n  cacheMeter         on            Prompt cache column (hit rate, time left)  (on | off)\n  cacheTtl           1h            Prompt cache lifetime  (1h | 5m)\n  usageMeters        on            Context and limit meters  (on | off)\n  palette            default       Colours of the bars and meters  (default | catppuccin-mocha | catppuccin-latte | dracula | alucard | night-owl | synthwave-84 | tokyo-night)\n  language           auto          Labels language  (auto | en | fr)\n  timeZone           Europe/Paris  Reset time zone (IANA)  (any text)\n\nChange one: /still-mods <option> <value>, e.g. /still-mods usageMeters off\nCommands: /still-mods-progress (show or hide the bars), /still-mods-progress-demo, /still-mods-progress-clear, /still-mods-progress-sounds"
